BaseConfigLib::initializeQualification
├── given zero entries
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single entry
│   ├── it should write qualificationData to storage for chainId
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple entries
│   ├── it should write all entries to storage
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given extra data after entries
│   └── it should return extra data as remaining
├── given ruleCount is zero
│   └── it should revert with QualificationRulesNotSet
└── given packedNodesLength is zero
    └── it should revert with QualificationRulesNotSet